```astro
---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
        title="About — Rajesh Nair"
        description="The professional journey of Rajesh Nair — software engineer, MongoDB Champion, author and speaker."
>
        <div class="page">
                <header class="page-header">
                        <p class="eyebrow">About</p>

                        <h1>A career built through detours.</h1>

                        <p class="lead">
                                I've spent more than 15 years building software,
                                working with databases and cloud technologies,
                                and gradually finding my way from application
                                development into backend engineering,
                                MongoDB, and the developer community.
                        </p>
                </header>

                <section class="story">
                        <h2>The journey</h2>

                        <p>
                                I didn't follow a perfectly planned path into
                                software engineering. My career has moved
                                through application development, database
                                administration, infrastructure, backend
                                engineering and cloud.
                        </p>

                        <p>
                                Each transition introduced something new —
                                technologies, problems, people and ways of
                                thinking. Many of those detours eventually
                                became some of the most valuable parts of my
                                career.
                        </p>

                        <p>
                                Today, alongside building software, I spend a
                                significant part of my time exploring
                                MongoDB, sharing what I learn, speaking at
                                community events and contributing to the
                                developer community.
                        </p>
                </section>

                <section class="timeline">
                        <div class="section-heading">
                                <p class="eyebrow">Experience</p>
                                <h2>Professional journey</h2>
                        </div>

                        <div class="timeline-list">
                                <article class="timeline-item current">
                                        <div class="date">2026 — Present</div>

                                        <div>
                                                <h3>HEMA</h3>
                                                <p class="role">
                                                        Senior Software Engineer
                                                </p>
                                                <p>
                                                        Building backend systems
                                                        for modern commerce,
                                                        working across Node.js,
                                                        cloud and distributed
                                                        systems.
                                                </p>
                                        </div>
                                </article>

                                <article class="timeline-item">
                                        <div class="date">2021 — 2026</div>

                                        <div>
                                                <h3>PVH Europe B.V.</h3>
                                                <p class="role">
                                                        Senior / Lead Software
                                                        Engineer
                                                </p>
                                                <p>
                                                        Worked on backend
                                                        engineering and
                                                        architecture for
                                                        large-scale
                                                        applications, with a
                                                        focus on cloud,
                                                        distributed systems
                                                        and engineering
                                                        practices.
                                                </p>
                                        </div>
                                </article>

                                <article class="timeline-item">
                                        <div class="date">2020 — 2021</div>

                                        <div>
                                                <h3>Wells Fargo</h3>
                                                <p class="role">
                                                        MongoDB Engineering
                                                </p>
                                                <p>
                                                        Supported MongoDB
                                                        environments across
                                                        more than 60 banking
                                                        application lines of
                                                        business, including
                                                        engineering, patching,
                                                        maintenance and
                                                        monitoring.
                                                </p>
                                        </div>
                                </article>

                                <article class="timeline-item">
                                        <div class="date">2017 — 2020</div>

                                        <div>
                                                <h3>NTT DATA Services</h3>
                                                <p class="role">
                                                        Database / MongoDB
                                                        Engineering
                                                </p>
                                                <p>
                                                        Supported MongoDB and
                                                        Progress database
                                                        environments across
                                                        ERP and banking
                                                        clients and developed
                                                        Python automation for
                                                        maintenance and
                                                        support.
                                                </p>
                                        </div>
                                </article>

                                <article class="timeline-item">
                                        <div class="date">2016 — 2017</div>

                                        <div>
                                                <h3>Hewlett Packard Enterprise</h3>
                                                <p class="role">
                                                        Software Engineer
                                                </p>
                                                <p>
                                                        Worked on a highly
                                                        scalable retail
                                                        application using
                                                        Progress OpenEdge,
                                                        MongoDB and Java, with
                                                        responsibilities across
                                                        development standards,
                                                        CI, database design and
                                                        deployment.
                                                </p>
                                        </div>
                                </article>

                                <article class="timeline-item">
                                        <div class="date">2015 — 2016</div>

                                        <div>
                                                <h3>Altisource Business Solutions</h3>
                                                <p class="role">
                                                        Software Engineer
                                                </p>
                                                <p>
                                                        Worked on banking
                                                        infrastructure
                                                        applications involving
                                                        architecture, database
                                                        design and software
                                                        development.
                                                </p>
                                        </div>
                                </article>

                                <article class="timeline-item">
                                        <div class="date">2011 — 2015</div>

                                        <div>
                                                <h3>IBS Software</h3>
                                                <p class="role">
                                                        Senior Software
                                                        Engineer / Team Lead
                                                </p>
                                                <p>
                                                        Built cruise booking
                                                        applications using Java,
                                                        Spring and Hibernate.
                                                        Worked across multiple
                                                        business modules and
                                                        was involved in
                                                        releases, deployments
                                                        and client-facing
                                                        delivery.
                                                </p>
                                        </div>
                                </article>
                        </div>
                </section>

                <section class="today">
                        <p class="eyebrow">Today</p>

                        <h2>Still learning. Still building.</h2>

                        <p>
                                My work today sits at the intersection of
                                backend engineering, cloud technologies,
                                databases and developer communities.
                        </p>

                        <div class="focus-grid">
                                <div>
                                        <h3>Engineering</h3>
                                        <p>
                                                Java, Node.js, AWS, distributed
                                                systems and backend architecture.
                                        </p>
                                </div>

                                <div>
                                        <h3>MongoDB</h3>
                                        <p>
                                                Champion, author, speaker and
                                                community contributor.
                                        </p>
                                </div>

                                <div>
                                        <h3>Sharing</h3>
                                        <p>
                                                Writing, talks, videos,
                                                experiments and open-source
                                                projects.
                                        </p>
                                </div>
                        </div>
                </section>
        </div>
</Layout>

<style>
        .page {
                max-width: 1000px;
                margin: 0 auto;
                padding: 5rem 1.5rem 7rem;
        }

        .page-header {
                max-width: 800px;
                padding-bottom: 5rem;
        }

        .eyebrow {
                margin: 0 0 1rem;
                color: var(--color-muted);
                font-size: 0.8rem;
                font-weight: 700;
                letter-spacing: 0.12em;
                text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        h1 {
                margin: 0;
                font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5.5rem);
                line-height: 1;
                letter-spacing: -0.055em;
        }

        .lead {
                margin: 2rem 0 0;
                max-width: 720px;
                color: var(--color-secondary);
                font-size: 1.25rem;
                line-height: 1.7;
        }

        section {
                margin-top: 5rem;
        }

        h2 {
                margin: 0;
                font-size: 2rem;
                letter-spacing: -0.03em;
        }

        .story {
                max-width: 720px;
                border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
                padding-top: 2rem;
        }

        .story h2 {
                margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .story p {
                color: var(--color-secondary);
                line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .timeline {
                border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
                padding-top: 2rem;
        }

        .section-heading {
                margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }

        .timeline-list {
                border-left: 1px solid var(--color-border-strong);
                margin-left: 7rem;
        }

        .timeline-item {
                position: relative;
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: 150px 1fr;
                gap: 2rem;
                padding: 0 0 3.5rem 2rem;
        }

        .timeline-item::before {
                content: "";
                position: absolute;
                left: -5px;
                top: 0.4rem;
                width: 9px;
                height: 9px;
                border-radius: 50%;
                background: var(--color-text);
        }

        .date {
                color: var(--color-muted);
                font-size: 0.9rem;
                line-height: 1.5;
        }

        h3 {
                margin: 0;
                font-size: 1.25rem;
        }

        .role {
                margin: 0.35rem 0 0.75rem;
                color: var(--color-secondary);
                font-weight: 600;
        }

        .timeline-item p:not(.role) {
                margin: 0;
                max-width: 600px;
                color: var(--color-muted);
                line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .current::before {
                width: 11px;
                height: 11px;
                left: -6px;
        }

        .today {
                border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
                padding-top: 2rem;
        }

        .today > p:not(.eyebrow) {
                max-width: 650px;
                color: var(--color-secondary);
                line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .focus-grid {
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
                gap: 1rem;
                margin-top: 2rem;
        }

        .focus-grid > div {
                padding: 1.5rem;
                border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
                border-radius: 12px;
        }

        .focus-grid p {
                margin-bottom: 0;
                color: var(--color-muted);
                line-height: 1.6;
        }

        @media (max-width: 700px) {
                .page {
                        padding-top: 3rem;
                }

                .timeline-list {
                        margin-left: 0.5rem;
                }

                .timeline-item {
                        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                        gap: 0.4rem;
                        padding-left: 1.5rem;
                }

                .focus-grid {
                        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                }
        }
</style>
```